(PROJECT OVERVIEW:) '
(This document contains the complete technical submission for the TC Hackathon challenge.) '
(Our solution focuses on building scalable classroom management tools and real-time student analytics.) '
() '
(KEY FEATURES IMPLEMENTED:) '
(1. Real-time Student & Faculty Synchronization) '
(2. Interactive Coding Sandbox with AI Grading) '
(3. Automated Submission Tracking & Feedback Loop) '
(4. Document & Resource Portal for Classrooms) '
() '
(SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE:) '
(- Frontend: Next.js App Router + React + Tailwind CSS) '
(- Backend: Next.js API Routes + Prisma ORM) '
(- Database: SQLite / PostgreSQL Schema with full multi-role support) '
() '
(CONCLUSION & FUTURE SCOPE:) '
(The project successfully satisfies all hackathon submission criteria and passed unit test suites.) '
